{"parse":{"title":"andavano","pageid":500236,"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"it\" dir=\"ltr\"><meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Italiano\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Flag_of_Italy.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"bandiera italiana\"><img alt=\"bandiera italiana\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Flag_of_Italy.svg/40px-Flag_of_Italy.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"27\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Flag_of_Italy.svg/120px-Flag_of_Italy.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1500\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Appendice:Italiano\" title=\"Appendice:Italiano\">Italiano</a></h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=andavano&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Modifica la sezione Italiano\"><span>modifica</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Voce_verbale\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Open_book_01.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f3/Open_book_01.svg/40px-Open_book_01.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f3/Open_book_01.svg/60px-Open_book_01.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"360\" /></a></span><i><a href=\"/wiki/voce_verbale\" title=\"voce verbale\">Voce verbale</a></i></h3></div> \n<p><b>andavano</b><small></small>\n</p>\n<ol><li>terza persona plurale dell'imperfetto indicativo di <a href=\"/wiki/andare\" title=\"andare\">andare</a>\n<ul><li><i>loro/essi <b>andavano</b></i></li></ul></li></ol>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Sillabazione\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Hyph_abc.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7f/Hyph_abc.svg/60px-Hyph_abc.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"45\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7f/Hyph_abc.svg/120px-Hyph_abc.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"260\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/sillabazione\" title=\"sillabazione\">Sillabazione</a></h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Template:-sill-&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Modifica la sezione Sillabazione\"><span>modifica</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<dl><dt>an | dà | va | no</dt></dl>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Etimologia_/_Derivazione\"><span id=\"Etimologia_.2F_Derivazione\"></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Nuvola_kdict_glass.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Nuvola_kdict_glass.svg/40px-Nuvola_kdict_glass.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Nuvola_kdict_glass.svg/60px-Nuvola_kdict_glass.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/etimologia\" title=\"etimologia\">Etimologia</a> / <a href=\"/wiki/derivazione\" title=\"derivazione\">Derivazione</a></h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Template:-etim-&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Modifica la sezione Etimologia / Derivazione\"><span>modifica</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>vedi <a href=\"/wiki/andare\" title=\"andare\">andare</a>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Traduzione\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gnome-globe.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f3/Gnome-globe.svg/40px-Gnome-globe.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f3/Gnome-globe.svg/60px-Gnome-globe.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"48\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/traduzione\" title=\"traduzione\">Traduzione</a></h3></div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"Mostra\" data-collapsetext=\"Nascondi\" style=\"padding:0.2em 0.6em 0.2em 0.6em; border-right:1px solid #BEBEBE; border-bottom:1px dotted black; background:#EDEDED; color:#000;\">terza persona plurale dell'imperfetto indicativo di andare\n<div class=\"z-index:-1; toccolours mw-collapsible-content\" style=\"border:0;\">\n<table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"translations\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"beige\" valign=\"top\" width=\"48%\">\n<dl><dd><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/bengalese\" title=\"bengalese\">bengalese</a>: তারা <a href=\"/wiki/%E0%A6%97%E0%A7%87%E0%A6%B2\" title=\"গেল\">গেল</a> (tara gelo), তাঁরা <a href=\"/wiki/%E0%A6%97%E0%A7%87%E0%A6%B2%E0%A7%87%E0%A6%A8\" title=\"গেলেন\">গেলেন</a> (tamra gelen)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/francese\" title=\"francese\">francese</a>: ils/elles <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=allaient&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"allaient (la pagina non esiste)\">allaient</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/inglese\" title=\"inglese\">inglese</a>: they <a href=\"/wiki/went#Inglese\" title=\"went\">went</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/latino\" title=\"latino\">latino</a>: illi <a href=\"/wiki/ibant#Latino\" title=\"ibant\">ībant</a>, illi <a href=\"/wiki/vadebant#Latino\" title=\"vadebant\">vādēbant</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/portoghese\" title=\"portoghese\">portoghese</a>: eles/elas <a href=\"/wiki/iam#Portoghese\" title=\"iam\">iam</a>, eles/elas <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=andavam&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"andavam (la pagina non esiste)\">andavam</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/spagnolo\" title=\"spagnolo\">spagnolo</a>: ellos/ellas/Uds. <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=iban&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"iban (la pagina non esiste)\">iban</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/tedesco\" title=\"tedesco\">tedesco</a>: Sie <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=gingen&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"gingen (la pagina non esiste)\">gingen</a></li></ul></dd></dl>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐api‐ext.eqiad.main‐5984d745ff‐dqt96\nCached time: 20261016082640\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [prevent‐selective‐update, show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.068 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.104 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1073/1000000\nRevision size: 725/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 1565/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 214/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 10/100\nExpensive parser function count: 1/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20